@page "/projects"

<PageTitle>Projects — Cole</PageTitle>

<section class="section">
    <h1>Projects</h1>
    <p class="section-intro">
        A few things I've built or worked on.
    </p>

    <div class="projects-grid">
        <div class="project-card">
            <h3>FLDCF Wizards</h3>
            <p>
                This allows FLDCF employees to easily change and manage applications for state support. This supports millions of applications yearly for government aid in the state of Florida. This entails Medicaid, SNAP, and TANF programs. Allowing FLDCF employees to manage these applications with ease.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
                <span class="tag">C#</span>
                <span class="tag">.NET</span>
                <span class="tag">Azure</span>
                <span class="tag">React</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="project-card">
            <h3>FLDCF Worker Portal</h3>
            <p>
                We created a new system for the FLDCF users to work through applications for assistance. This took going through old code and databases and converting it to a modern framework and design. This was also the base to the rest of the project as its a multi year project with several phases.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
                <span class="tag">C#</span>
                <span class="tag">.NET</span>
                <span class="tag">Azure</span>
                <span class="tag">React</span>
                <span class="tag">MSSQL</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="project-card">
            <h3>Monthly E&O Survey</h3>
            <p>
                Its a monthly survey that goes out to over 6,000 teammates monthly to answer questions to keep the company in compliance with legal standards. I developed and helped conceptualize this while at Brown & Brown.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
                <span class="tag">Azure Logic Apps</span>
                <span class="tag">C#</span>
                <span class="tag">.NET</span>
                <span class="tag">Power BI</span>
