            <h3>JUA</h3>
            <p>
                Modernization project I took on at Brown & Brown. This is a site that users had to be able to upload and download large files on. With extra security down to each file and folder having its own associated security matrix.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
                <span class="tag">Entra ID</span>
