        <div class="project-card">
            <h3>Qualys Report</h3>
            <p>
                On this project I connected to Qualys data and ingested it into a MSSQL database each day. I then created a Power BI report that management and the cyber security team could see each day. Showing them what vulnerabilites our equipment had. Allowing them to prioriotze and track fixes to the servers.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
                <span class="tag">Power BI</span>
